		(uuid "5089e2fb-498a-5eee-999c-e20827ba4bc6")
	)
	(text "1. EXP_I2C_SDA/SCL reach the host I2C bus through over-voltage protector U10 and repeater U6 on\n   sheet 7 (Protected external signals).\n2. EXP_INT_INPUT is a shared interrupt line: R17 (10 kΩ) pulls it up to EXP_3V3 and U9 buffers it for\n   the host, both on sheet 7 (Protected external signals).\n3. EXP_3V3 comes from LDO U4 on sheet 2 (Protected power domains).\n4. Each connector has a TPD4E05U06 clamp beside it on sheet 9 (Connector-local ESD):\n   U17-U21 at JP1-JP5, U25 at J4, U22 at X1, U23 at X3."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 171.45 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a88efd05-162a-56ba-8ede-4fde51d7b706")
	)
